<section class="page-intro"><a class="breadcrumb" href="<%- url_for('/') %>">首页 / 星标收藏</a><span class="eyebrow">MY OPEN SOURCE PANTRY</span><h1 class="page-title">好的灵感，值得加星。</h1><p>收藏在 GitHub 里的工具、项目和新鲜想法。下次需要的时候，来这里翻翻。</p><div class="stars-summary"><span><%- icon('star') %><strong><%= site.data.stars.total %></strong> 个公开星标</span><a href="<%= config.github %>?tab=stars" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@<%= config.github_username %> <%- icon('diagonal') %></a><span>更新于 <%= date(site.data.stars.updated_at, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></span></div></section><section data-star-browser><label class="search-box"><%- icon('search') %><input type="search" id="star-search" placeholder="搜索项目名称、描述或技术栈…" aria-label="搜索星标项目" autocomplete="off"><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="filter-bar star-filters" role="group" aria-label="按语言筛选"><button class="filter-chip is-active" data-filter="all">全部项目</button><% [...new Set(site.data.stars.repositories.map(repo => repo.language || 'Other'))].sort().forEach(language => { %><button class="filter-chip" data-filter="<%= language %>"><%= language %></button><% }) %></div><div class="results-toolbar"><span>找到 <strong data-result-count><%= site.data.stars.total %></strong> 个项目</span><span>最近收藏优先</span></div><div class="star-grid"><% site.data.stars.repositories.forEach(repo => { %><%- partial('_partial/star-card',{repo}) %><% }) %></div><div class="empty-state glass-card" hidden><%- icon('star') %><h3>还没有这道收藏</h3><p>换个关键词或语言试试。</p><button class="button button-ghost" data-reset-search>清除筛选</button></div></section>
